      "text": "Customer app — one job, done offline",
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 2740
    },
    "nA": {
      "x": 1330,
      "y": 40,
      "w": 360,
      "text": "Ground #E3E8F0, one indigo for staff, one teal for customers.\n\nShadows carry depth. They never carry state — a soft shadow vanishes in Surat daylight, so every state is a saturated chip with real contrast.",
      "fill": "blue"
    },
    "nB": {
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 1700,
      "w": 360,
      "text": "Four things are on every field screen without opening a menu: the connection, when it last synced, how many items are queued, and — one tap away — why each one has not gone yet.",
      "fill": "blue"
    },
    "nD": {
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 4068,
      "w": 360,
      "text": "Two operators can take the same parcel while neither can see the other. The loser sees who won and when, on the record, with no error modal.",
      "fill": "purple"
    },
    "nF": {
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 6436,
      "w": 360,
      "text": "The single most useful support screen in the app. It turns “the app is broken” into “three items queued, oldest four hours, last error a network timeout”.",
      "fill": "orange"
    }
  },
